Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.62,0:00:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You win!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.82,0:00:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we are,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,traveling through the forest to\Ndefeat the Stratum Lord and hopefully
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,turn the trees that used to be\Nvillagers back into people again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.40,0:00:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, this is all quite a bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.26,0:00:20.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall absorb the\Nfelled tree with fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monsters aren't attacking\Nthe village anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But felling trees is\Nsending them into a frenzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.76,0:00:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And launch reinforced plastic\Nbottles filled with pachinko balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why's it gotta be so stinky?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.42,0:00:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They smell bad, they taste great!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat too much now or\Nyou'll be too full to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Elder Tree Fiend\NStratum Lord. It's still not
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.38,0:01:10.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,coming after us it was\Noriginally quite gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of guardian deity\Nfor this stratum when
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it attacked the village\Nwe were all shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.58,0:01:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I for one blame the Nether\NLord that may be but
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.18,0:01:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if you want to turn the\Ntree people back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.54,0:01:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, then we'll have to beat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.31,0:01:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm positive that\Npouring this anti-plant
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,poison right onto it\Nshould accomplish that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.24,0:01:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan is to use Lamas,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuroyata, and the old man's magic\Nto pour what's in those barrels?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,into its eyes and mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.60,0:01:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do that, we'll have to get to its\Nbase first, which is no easy task.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who knows how much time we have.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.08,0:01:49.00,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside I'm just a big metal box\Nbut inside I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.00,0:01:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of\Nwonders I travel to and
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.38,0:02:02.26,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.40,0:02:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fro on the back of my\Nsuper strong partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.22,0:02:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lammis, the name's Boxxo. Hello\Nthere. That means "yes". By the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.30,0:02:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.00,0:03:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:19.09,0:03:22.97,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,435)\fscx72\pos(522,51)}Conflagration
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.66,0:03:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo, all my energy is depleted\Nbecause I'm so hungry I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, save me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely freezing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sucks that we can't even\Nstart a fire to warm up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to rub it in, but I don't feel cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not with this awesome magic\Ncloak I got from Voxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, the cloak from the weapons shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought it and gave\Nit to Lamas as a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you get me anything, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.24,0:03:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, way to dodge the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about you revisit this\Nlove triangle drama later, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.28,0:03:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so hungry my stomach's turned into\Nsome kind of monster eating itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.76,0:03:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.26,0:03:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.36,0:03:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mustn't forget my duty\Nas a vending machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold, so how about some cup ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, let's make dinner a\Nlittle more elaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.68,0:04:07.85,sign_Verdana,text (big left),0,0,0,,{\pos(210,111)\c&H342114&\3c&HD7AB93&\shad0\fad(191,1)\fax-0.22}Soba
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.68,0:04:07.85,sign_Verdana,text (big right),0,0,0,,{\c&H342114&\3c&HD7AB93&\shad0\fad(191,1)\fax-0.22\pos(330,111)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.22,0:04:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo changed into a shape\NI've never seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.56,0:04:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are these new products?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.10,0:04:13.60,sign_Verdana,text (big left),0,0,0,,{\c&H342114&\3c&HD7AB93&\shad0\pos(214,74)}Soba
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.10,0:04:13.60,sign_Verdana,text (big right),0,0,0,,{\c&H342114&\3c&HD7AB93&\shad0\fs18\pos(324,64)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.60,0:04:17.27,sign_Verdana,text (top left),0,0,0,,{\fs12\c&H332016&\3c&H4B6583&\shad0\an8}Kitsune soba   Tempura udon\N {\c&HAD846E&\3c&H2E1C14&\shad0\bord3\fs15\fnArial Narrow}Press
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.96,0:04:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quick question, folks.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.31,0:04:18.36,sign_Arial,text (top),0,0,0,,{\pos(320,145)\fs15\c&HCBA790&\fad(2697,1)}Cooking time left
Dialogue: 1,0:04:15.31,0:04:18.36,sign_Arial,text (bottom),0,0,0,,{\fs12\c&HCBA790&\fad(2697,1)\pos(400,205)}seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.62,0:04:19.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever heard of\Nthe term auto restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.18,0:04:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were 24-hour vending machine-only\Nrestaurants that were once built
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.86,0:04:25.36,sign_Verdana,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H2C18A5&\shad0\bord4\fsp6\fs20\3c&HC2C2C4&}Auto Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.42,0:04:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along highways where motorists could\Npull over and eat anytime they wanted.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.36,0:04:27.87,sign_Verdana,text (orange can),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&HEAF0EF&\3c&H1042DE&\shad0\bord3\fsp2}Orange {\c&H1248DE&\3c&HF0F0F3&}soda\N{\c&H6F4B94&\3c&HF7FCF4&\fs18} Grape soda
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.54,0:04:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were a big fad, and they coincided\Nwith the spreading craze of video games.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.12,0:04:37.88,sign_Verdana,text (top),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H2C18A5&\shad0\bord4\fsp6\fs20\3c&HEDEDF3&}Open 24 hours\N{\fs25}Auto Restaurant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.28,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But about 10 years later, with the\Nadvent of the convenience store,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their numbers started\Nto gradually decline.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is one of those retro-bending\Nmachines that once took the world by storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:47.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is different\Nfrom the usual pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's kind of thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it's so warm and savory!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:04:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thick pasta is more filling,\Nand this broth is to die for!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.34,0:04:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an unusual flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, how do you always deliver?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kelp broth is rare in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.76,0:05:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People go wild for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:06.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want some! Yeah, me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me three!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.02,0:05:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me four!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.96,0:05:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want second!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.28,0:05:15.41,sign_Verdana,text (left),0,0,0,,{\move(205,130,215,130)\c&H342114&\3c&HD7AB93&\shad0\fad(191,95)\fax-0.22}Soba
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.28,0:05:15.41,sign_Verdana,text (right),0,0,0,,{\c&H342114&\3c&HD7AB93&\shad0\fad(191,95)\fax-0.22\move(336,121,325,120)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.36,0:05:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stop there, though, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, we're changing the menu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.72,0:05:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.21,0:05:17.29,sign_Arial,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\b0\pos(397,142)\fs12\c&H555B6C&\3c&H6BB3A2&\shad0\fad(106,1)}Cooks in 60 seconds
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.21,0:05:17.29,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (top left),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&HD4CACB&\3c&HA7A0A8&\4c&H739F94&\pos(198,56)\fad(106,1)\fax-0.29}Piping hot
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.21,0:05:17.29,sign_Verdana,text (top right),0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(370,57)\fax-0.29\c&HE0BAA6&\3c&H290087&\bord3\shad0\fsp2\fad(106,1)}Gutenburger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, he turned into a\Ndifferent shape already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now do we get to try the\Nfood in this picture?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.30,0:05:24.30,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\b0\move(325,340,320,330)\fs31\c&H5036A3&\3c&H47F5F4&\shad0\fad(106,1)}Cooks in 60 seconds
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's brooming with meat juice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:29.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a new favorite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.80,0:05:32.06,sign_Arial,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\c&H56A0D5&\pos(328,165)\frz14.87\b0\fs12\shad0\3c&H52F6F4&\fax-0.11}Cooks in 60 seconds
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.80,0:05:32.06,sign_TrebuchetMS,text (top left),0,0,0,,{\an7\fs10\c&HDDE9F3&\3c&H8DBAE7&\4c&H739F94&\fad(106,1)\fax-0.29\frz18.28\pos(162,116)\shad0}Piping hot
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.80,0:05:32.06,sign_Verdana,text (top right),0,0,0,,{\an8\fax-0.29\c&HE7E7EE&\3c&H1900DA&\bord3\shad0\fsp2\fad(106,1)\frz19.61\pos(312,59)}Gutenburger
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like this went over well, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.22,0:05:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, I think this is the best\Nthing you've given us yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.82,0:05:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot and fresh and tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.22,0:05:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll say. Delicious meat surrounded\Nby two pieces of bread, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.54,0:05:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my former life as a vending\Nmachine enthusiast, this was my hobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I loved traveling from\Nplace to place sampling
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the different vending\Nmachines' products.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.78,0:05:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friends judged my hobby, calling\Nit a waste of time and money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I sure am happy that it's proving\Nuseful to the people of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikoyu and I are taking turns\Nbeing in charge of meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't use fire,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:20.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so all she can fix are fruits and\Nvegetables that can be eaten raw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.18,0:06:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are a big hit, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.76,0:06:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So good, can't handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.78,0:06:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's plenty more\Nwhere that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:27.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might be getting annoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.60,0:06:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some decades back, someone defeated\None of the Elder Tree Fiends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.02,0:06:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear they did it by burning\Nit to a crisp with fire magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That started a great fire on this stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for ten years it was a sad place where\Nneither monsters nor people could live.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:49.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that must be why fire\Nis banned in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta say, it's kind of inconvenient\Nnot being able to use fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.38,0:06:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's surprisingly chilly\Nat night in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the more so after all the\Nsweaty work during the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.70,0:07:01.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And everyone's covered in dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.58,0:07:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only they could take a nice hot bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.02,0:07:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I almost forgot about my hot\Nsprings vending machine function.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.93,0:07:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the next one! Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, the foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Above that goes the bathtub, and\Nover there's the changing area.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.10,0:07:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is definitely a high-level\Ncollaborative DIY project.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The handcrafted open-air bath is complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.82,0:07:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.18,0:07:28.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot water time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looking good so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.34,0:07:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulumi's design was flawless as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. This is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is, however, no guarantee\Nthat no monsters lurk nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.52,0:07:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As such, I volunteer for guard duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.08,0:07:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fear not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.99,0:07:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear by the gods that I would\Nnever even dream of peeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.38,0:07:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You needn't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.30,0:07:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.66,0:07:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Botan and Kuroyata will\Nstand guard for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.94,0:08:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First bath in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.38,0:08:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's Boxo doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we are gonna need towels and\Nthat foamy liquid stuff after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.78,0:08:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but we can get those in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.52,0:08:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Inside of Boxo, there lives the soul\Nof a human man with all its foibles.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.88,0:08:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that may be true, but as long\Nas it's just Boxo, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.26,0:08:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you two just\Nstanding there gabbing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.28,0:08:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You forget that there are\Nmonsters in this forest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta get in, get\Nout, and nobody gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm with Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, I suppose I don't really mind\Neither, as long as it's only Voxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.40,0:08:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lom, it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.64,0:08:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Boxxo. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and buy enough for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see, we'll need more towels\Nand some of that foamy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you and I are both standing guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This must be what paradise is like. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I honestly can't believe\Nhow relaxing this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guarantee I'm going\Nto sleep well tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.04,0:09:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warm and cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kuroyata, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't the sky over\Nthere seem unusually red?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.68,0:09:17.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The forest is on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell everyone to gather up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.93,0:09:42.01,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,text,0,0,0,,{\blur3\an8\fs20\pos(481,136)}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N {\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.74,0:09:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black Black, what's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's up\Nany better than you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.28,0:09:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but my guess is that somebody's\Nburned the elder tree fiends
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.46,0:10:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stratum Lord to death We can\Nlook into that later right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're racing against time to get out of\Nthis forest You're right, band of gluttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.44,0:10:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Stratum Lord has\Ntruly been defeated,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.86,0:10:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the inhabitants who turned into\Ntrees should have recovered too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.60,0:10:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You four go back to the\Nvillage and tell them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.40,0:10:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to evacuate the Clear\NFlow Lake Stratum at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The transfer circle should be functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do we do, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some reconnaissance is in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to confirm that the Elder\NTree Fiend has truly been defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it hasn't, the people who turned into\Ntrees will burn to death in the Inferno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.58,0:10:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.26,0:10:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either uproot or cut down\Nthe surrounding trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kikuyu, go and dispose\Nof every last plank.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.94,0:10:42.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui, keep an eye on our\Nsurroundings just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.36,0:10:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's slow that fire\Ndown as much as we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But will that be enough to\Nhold back a fire that intense?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.98,0:11:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's the only way to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:15.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, I need a favor. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:17.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hulemy, do you have some secret plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.98,0:11:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, can't you change into something\Nthat dispenses highly flammable oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:22.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change into that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.67,0:11:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then I want you to spread oil\Nfrom here right to the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spread kerosene around when\Nthere's a blaze coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.78,0:11:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be like signing\Nour own death warrants.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:37.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Boxxo, just trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She means it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.08,0:11:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.56,0:11:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I so appreciate you, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good. Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:50.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.32,0:11:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight fire with fire. Boxxo? Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.16,0:11:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.07,0:11:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.22,0:11:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.02,0:12:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This forest's trees catch fire easily\Nand then burn up rather quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.38,0:12:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if we burn these away first,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.38,0:12:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can keep that blaze from\Ngetting any closer to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's an excellent plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:14.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I should have\Ntrusted you. Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.44,0:12:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still a huge gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fire's too intense at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.24,0:12:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just have to protect\Nus with my barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:32.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But its range is so limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To protect this many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.82,0:12:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time to mull it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.44,0:12:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.35,0:12:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're getting massive, so move.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean move away from you? Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.50,0:12:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.58,0:12:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activate barrier!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:08.89,0:13:13.39,sign_CourierNew,text,0,0,0,,{\an5\shad0\3c&H36150F&\bord4}Points decreased by 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.32,0:13:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's some serious heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm losing points like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are still a little hot,\Nbut I think we're okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:33.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved us there, Boxo. You are what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, point. It's low.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.74,0:13:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for doing that for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.36,0:13:41.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you know we're grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.64,0:13:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we get back safely, I'll\Nrepay you with lots of coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.54,0:13:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we get home, I'll smash my\Npiggy bank and help out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thought alone more than counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Boxer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have one gold coin on me right\Nnow, but hopefully that will help a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.86,0:13:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.18,0:14:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'll thank you\Nproperly when we get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.10,0:14:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never live it down\Nif you thought the Dark
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.06,0:14:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forest Stratum was full\Nof chintzy cheapskates.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may look like a shadow,\Nbut I ain't shady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:13.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, with that settled, I\Ncan be of a bit more use.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the Elder Tree Fiend has been\Ndefeated, that solves one problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.06,0:14:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this damage is too extensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.50,0:14:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What damn fool would\Nhave done such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.54,0:14:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'll pay for it when I find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:30.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put my foot so far up their\Nass, they'll taste my shoe leather!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just has to be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might just be the bark that's burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.18,0:14:48.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't any voice, it would\Nseem that it is dead indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas, try hitting the trunk at\Nfull strength just to make sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.86,0:14:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that answers that. Good. Down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.18,0:15:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who dares wake me up from my sweet,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sweet nap?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe she is wearing\Nboots, but they're see-through,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I don't imagine those can come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.30,0:15:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just who might you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.00,0:15:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rich coming from\Nyou, rude intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.36,0:15:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Kayolings, known far\Nand wide as the terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.44,0:15:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unignorable, shouting, songstress!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heard of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.16,0:15:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not even a whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.80,0:15:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you hick bumpkins from\Nif you don't even know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.56,0:15:40.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean where?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.90,0:15:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.26,0:15:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, just forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:46.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for Lammis idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, do you guys live\Nunder a rock or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.04,0:15:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, our being Lammis idiots aside,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.66,0:15:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'd like to know what you're doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.66,0:15:54.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dare ask me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, I guess I'll tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:16:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To turn this stratum\Ninto a sea of fire And
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to kill off every last\Nlame ass idiot in it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,along with all the stupid\Nlame ass idiot fools who
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are bothering the wicked\Nmetal as hell left on General!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.18,0:16:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.46,0:16:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're working for the Netherlord then.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:15.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:19.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm one of the Netherlord's\Nhardcore badass devoted followers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.18,0:16:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call me Kayolings Junior General!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's probably some sort of undead,\Nso regular weapons won't work on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack with caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.68,0:16:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we were gonna trade\Nsome more insults, but fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no problem with\Nfighting it out instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.74,0:16:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So go on, attack me, why don't ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.10,0:16:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think arrows will work?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:46.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That really hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.14,0:16:48.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, those arrows\Nwere endowed with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:51.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magic even works on someone\Nwho's basically a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.18,0:16:54.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My oh my, I don't deal\Nwell with noisy women.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You assholes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.60,0:17:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody who wants to live\Nmesses with my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect you to fight like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.14,0:17:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ones the Left-Armed\NGeneral said to watch out for!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.02,0:17:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, it looks like Kuroyata\Nwent and stole the show. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.28,0:17:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't do a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we've managed to capture\Nsomeone high up that's major.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.62,0:17:50.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope we can get some\Ninformation out of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.48,0:17:54.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This definitely wasn't\Nbecause our opponent was weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This group is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ridiculously strong,\Nespecially those two old folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They kicked some butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.25,0:18:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welp, I didn't manage to do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I can at least be a good\Nvending machine and provide enough
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,food and drink to fill everyone's\Nbellies after a job well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.82,0:18:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I worked up an appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loxo, what are you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,serving?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.77,0:18:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for me, I could use a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, something nice and refreshing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.20,0:18:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Stratum, it sat empty for\Ndecades before and now it will again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know telling you not to be\Ndiscouraged might be asking quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.40,0:18:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we'll accept all the residents?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.02,0:18:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,at Clear Flow Lake Straton.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of that, you can rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.90,0:18:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But did everyone manage\Nto evacuate in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.12,0:18:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have faith that the\Nband of glutton's little
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.40,0:18:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,legs reached the village\Nbefore the fire did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And their sense of smell?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.04,0:18:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's keen enough to help guide every\Nlast one of the people to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm sure that you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.16,0:18:49.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, there was so\Nmuch green in this forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.80,0:18:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not Director Dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's not my stratum but it does\Nhurt to see it was so beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:19:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before we only did what needed\Nto be done so there's no use
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wringing our hands over it that's\Nright we tried our very best and
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we saved many people that's all\Nwe can do it's enough that we're
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all alive and kicking life will\Nfind a way in the forest will be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,green again yes the people can\Nwalk on so long as they have the
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,proper footwear the road may be\Nrough but a good pair of boots
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.46,0:19:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can carry you far i know heavy's\NHe's trying to sound encouraging,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it always gets a little weird the\Nmoment he starts talking about footwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We mustn't ever give up, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:34.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as passion fills our\Nhearts, nothing can stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.06,0:19:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.52,0:19:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for cheering me up, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:47.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Botan, would you mind\Nrunning a little faster?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.38,0:20:03.59,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,438)\fscx72\an1\pos(254,296)}Clearflow Lake Stratum
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.14,0:20:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Director.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.36,0:20:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad everyone made it back safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.94,0:20:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are all in good health? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.32,0:20:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The monsters have calmed down\Nand reconstruction is going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:16.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a large group of new residents\Narrived from the Dark Forest Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:21.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First thing go get some rest
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.42,0:20:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have to tell me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, what should we do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.88,0:20:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go home and take it easy things\Nhave been hectic So we could do that
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.98,0:20:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to work
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone will have\Na problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always feel calmer in this stratum.\NNow, let's do some big-time business.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.16,0:20:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm fresh vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet I'll take some you got any fruit
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please form a line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.70,0:20:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've prepared lots of vegetables,\Nso please line up single file.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way I can distribute\Nthem more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.72,0:20:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was about to run out of ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I get 30 each of those\Ngourds I got from you before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.56,0:21:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:03.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember, Kiko, you talking about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.46,0:21:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She said that she could do lots of\Nbusiness selling vegetables on the stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.98,0:21:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.89,0:21:10.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's where all my\Nusual customers have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.18,0:21:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an even bigger problem\Nthan that chain restaurant debacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there. Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:18.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, box of old pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, glad you're back.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.96,0:21:21.67,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(530,30)\c&HB38F3C&\3c&HF2EFF0&\shad0\bord3}Family Market
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.30,0:21:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.21,0:21:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen these products before.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.67,0:21:27.68,sign_Verdana,text (lower left pink),0,0,0,,{\c&HA4A5BE&\3c&H5246A6&\shad0\an8\fs15}Strawberry milk\N{\3c&H317EA1&} Fruit milk
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.20,0:21:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bears will eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.68,0:21:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even in another world, the way to\Nthe ladies' hearts is through sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:35.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will they choose, cake or candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could go either way,\Nbecause what I got is tops.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.76,0:21:45.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The following day, much to my chagrin,\Nall the ladies were back in Kikuyu's line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.45,0:21:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please form an orderly line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of sugary, hot,\Nstill-baked sweet for babies to go around!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.32,0:21:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's autumn now, so selling\Nsweet potatoes was a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:21:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, my new rival may have won\Nthis battle, but this is war!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God bless you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.64,0:23:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could even win a reward!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.09,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (upper left),0,0,0,,{\pos(50,60)\fs14}Next Time
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.01,0:23:40.09,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an1\fs19\fsp4\pos(215,295)}The Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.42,0:23:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look forward to serving you again!

